WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.591 --> 00:00:04.744
(upbeat music)

00:00:04.744 --> 00:00:06.327
- Oh shit I'm late.

00:00:08.609 --> 00:00:09.605
Up, up, up, let's go.

00:00:09.605 --> 00:00:11.163
C'mon we didn't even
check your homework folder

00:00:11.163 --> 00:00:12.551
this weekend, oh my God.

00:00:12.551 --> 00:00:15.157
Sweetheart you have a
science project due today.

00:00:15.157 --> 00:00:17.238
Why didn't you tell me this?

00:00:17.238 --> 00:00:20.321
How are we supposed to get this done?

00:00:22.249 --> 00:00:23.993
- [Voiceover] Mom.

00:00:23.993 --> 00:00:28.013
- Oh my God, this is not
that bad, I can fix this.

00:00:28.013 --> 00:00:29.260
Sweetheart I'll give you a dollar

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:31.843
if you find mommy's sunglasses.

00:00:33.593 --> 00:00:36.256
- Oh thanks, thank you so
much for making me coffee

00:00:36.256 --> 00:00:39.589
and leaving me some, oh, you're welcome.

00:00:41.465 --> 00:00:43.439
Oh shit I forgot bread.

00:00:43.439 --> 00:00:46.692
Sweetheart I'm gonna
pack you some leftovers.

00:00:46.692 --> 00:00:49.586
Really yummy leftovers okay?

00:00:49.586 --> 00:00:50.608
- [Voiceover] Okay.

00:00:50.608 --> 00:00:52.613
- God what is that?

00:00:52.613 --> 00:00:53.446
Oh God.

00:00:54.542 --> 00:00:59.493
Hey honey, does mold count
as a science experiment?

00:00:59.493 --> 00:01:02.174
This is your science project.

00:01:02.174 --> 00:01:03.757
Alright, got your backpack, purse, phone.

00:01:03.757 --> 00:01:05.259
Alright sweetheart get your shoes on,

00:01:05.259 --> 00:01:06.281
I'm gonna load the car,

00:01:06.281 --> 00:01:07.745
we're getting Starbucks for breakfast.

00:01:07.745 --> 00:01:09.469
Ya-hoo, mommy needs her coffee.

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:13.213
Hurry up with those shoes, we're late.

00:01:13.213 --> 00:01:15.095
Just kidding, mommy forgot her pants.

00:01:15.095 --> 00:01:16.529
- Nice outfit.

00:01:16.529 --> 00:01:19.343
- Oh thanks Karen, nice face lift.

00:01:19.343 --> 00:01:20.559
- Oh.

00:01:20.559 --> 00:01:23.142
(upbeat music)

